WEBVTT

00:44:26.104 --> 00:44:30.140
that isn't comfortably talked about
that much by many people.

00:44:30.164 --> 00:44:32.962
It's just a hard conversation
to have with anyone,

00:44:32.986 --> 00:44:38.343
and yet almost everyone goes through
intense grief at some point.

00:44:38.367 --> 00:44:40.351
I had my own story.

00:44:40.375 --> 00:44:43.889
Eight years ago, I lost
my 24-year-old daughter,

00:44:43.913 --> 00:44:46.771
and, you know, I had, um ...

00:44:46.795 --> 00:44:48.451
yeah, the world disappeared.

00:44:48.475 --> 00:44:54.268
And there aren't many sources,

00:44:54.292 --> 00:44:56.361
like, people don't know
how to talk to you.

00:44:56.385 --> 00:44:58.237
They don't know how to relate to you.

00:44:58.261 --> 00:44:59.624
Everyone is loving,

00:44:59.648 --> 00:45:02.495
but they don't know how to help.